    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Cats of Egypt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a mystical journey through ancient Egypt, where over 100 clever cats have concealed themselves among the pyramids, temples, and bustling bazaars. Can you spot them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:<br>\u2022 More than 100 uniquely hidden cats waiting to be discovered<br>\u2022 Beautiful hand-drawn Egyptian sceneries spanning from the Nile River to ancient monuments<br>\u2022 Relaxing soundtrack inspired by traditional Egyptian music<br>\u2022 Perfect for short gaming sessions - find a few cats at a time, save your progress, and return later</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from your daily routine and immerse yourself in this charming hidden object adventure. Each cat has its own personality and hiding style, making every discovery a delightful surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The base game includes one complete level. Additional levels are available through DLC purchase.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Cats of Egypt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a mystical journey through ancient Egypt, where over 100 clever cats have concealed themselves among the pyramids, temples, and bustling bazaars. Can you spot them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:<br>\u2022 More than 100 uniquely hidden cats waiting to be discovered<br>\u2022 Beautiful hand-drawn Egyptian sceneries spanning from the Nile River to ancient monuments<br>\u2022 Relaxing soundtrack inspired by traditional Egyptian music<br>\u2022 Perfect for short gaming sessions - find a few cats at a time, save your progress, and return later</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from your daily routine and immerse yourself in this charming hidden object adventure. Each cat has its own personality and hiding style, making every discovery a delightful surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The base game includes one complete level. Additional levels are available through DLC purchase.</p>",
    "short_description": "Discover 100+ hidden cats in ancient Egypt's beautiful scenes. A relaxing hidden object game blending feline charm with Egyptian mystery.",
